#ASSERT `Art 83(e) the appeal is admissible against the decision refusing to authorise prosecution` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f)(1): args (procurement field, legal question of fundamental importance arises, procuring body reserved by item 1)
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(1) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(1) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(1) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING     -- "vorbehalten bleiben Beschwerden gegen Beschaffungen des Bundesverwaltungsgerichts ..."
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(1) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where no legal question of fundamental importance arises` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f)(2): args (procurement field, estimated value, threshold): "nicht erreicht" means below the threshold; equal to the threshold reaches it
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(2) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where the estimated value is below the threshold` TRUE 99 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(2) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where the estimated value is below the threshold` TRUE 100 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(2) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where the estimated value is below the threshold` TRUE 101 100 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 83(f)(2) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision where the estimated value is below the threshold` FALSE 99 100 EQUALS NOTHING
-- (f): args (procurement field, legal question, reserved body, estimated value, threshold)
#ASSERT `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE FALSE FALSE 100 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- item 1: no legal question
#ASSERT `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE TRUE FALSE 99 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE        -- item 2: below the threshold
#ASSERT `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE TRUE FALSE 100 100 EQUALS NOTHING           -- a legal question, value reaches the threshold
#ASSERT `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE FALSE TRUE 100 100 EQUALS NOTHING           -- reserved body, value reaches the threshold
#ASSERT `Art 83(f) the appeal is admissible against the procurement decision` TRUE FALSE TRUE 99 100 EQUALS JUST FALSE        -- reserved body but below the threshold: item 2 still bars (fork F9)
